data: {"id": "fcc96b4c07284864-thinking-parallel_evidence-990", "run_id": "fcc96b4c07284864", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实总结\n\n### ✅ Kubernetes 事实（Pod 状态 + Events + YAML）\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`Pending`，容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting`，原因 `ImagePullBackOff`。**异常仍然存在**。\n\n2. **镜像配置**：\n   - Image: `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`\n   - imagePullPolicy: `Always`\n   - **没有配置 `imagePullSecrets`**\n\n3. **Events 中的关键错误信息**：\n   ```\n   Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": \n   failed to resolve reference \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": \n   failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invali", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789352183768, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

